%N A274089 Numbers repeated except that powers of 2 only appear once.
%C A274089 Conjectured to be (essentially) the first differences of A002960. [Proved in Leonov (2026). - _Andrei Leonov_, Oct 21 2026]
%H A274089 Paolo Xausa, <a href="/A274089/b274089.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10000</a>
%H A274089 Andrei Leonov, <a href="https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23183139">The square-root take-away game, the Josephus problem, and Silverman's square sieve</a>, Zenodo, 2026.
%F A274089 a(n) = floor(A057716(n) / 2). - _Kevin Ryde_, Apr 28 2024
%t A274089 Flatten[Table[m, {m, 64}, {1 + Unitize[BitAnd[m, m - 1]]}]] (* _Paolo Xausa_, Oct 29 2026 *)
%o A274089 (PARI) a(n) = n++; my(k=logint(n,2)); n+=k; (n + bittest(n,k+1)) >> 1; \\ _Kevin Ryde_, Apr 28 2024
%o A274089 (Python)
%o A274089 def A274089(n): return n+(k:=n.bit_length())+bool(n+k&(1<<k))>>1 # _Chai Wah Wu_, Sep 05 2024
